/*
===============================================================================
Stored Procedure: silver.load_silver
===============================================================================
Purpose:
    This stored procedure loads and transforms data from the Bronze Layer
    into the Silver Layer of the Data Warehouse.

Main Operations:
    - Cleans and standardizes customer data.
    - Transforms and validates product information.
    - Validates sales data and converts date formats.
    - Standardizes customer identifiers, gender, and country names.
    - Tracks loading duration for each table and the overall process.
    - Handles errors using TRY...CATCH.

Process:
    The procedure truncates the existing Silver tables and reloads them
    with cleaned and transformed data from the Bronze Layer.

Usage:
    EXEC silver.load_silver;

===============================================================================
*/
